      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tilton%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In the 1850s, Abraham Lincoln is reputed to have had Thanksgiving dinner at Lucian Tilton’s house in Tilton.",
